  "summary": [
    "Long-run base rate for a 2/3 majority in Hungary under the 199-seat system is leveraged but not determinative; current signal is mixed.",
    "Opposition consolidation around Tisza and polling momentum in some surveys raise the odds of 133+ seats via winner-compensation mechanics.",
